   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Warm documentary: median ~101, blacks ~20, warm-olive shadows (39,38,24), highlights softened to ~223, medium saturation (0.29), warm skin (hue 24). Best for: Candid reportage, baraat and sangeet energy, family moments, mixed daylight-plus-tungsten interiors. Honest, timeless documentary tone.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
